    "p_new": "P_A union P_extra",
    "p_a_preservation": "Every A interval and its record binding is retained; no A interval enters a cap, NMS, merge, sort truncation, or budget eviction. Exact interval equality is the only union deduplication.",
    "support_threshold": {
      "definition": "For each outer fold, score every outer-train recording with that fold's already saved A estimator, including background and IGNORE rows, then use the fixed 0.70 quantile of those scores.",
